# Note: OCISessionBar.xcodeproj IS committed even though it is generated from
# project.yml by XcodeGen. Committing it keeps CI free of an XcodeGen install and
# lets anyone open the project without extra tooling. Regenerate with `xcodegen`
# after editing project.yml.
